lame -- IRC leet-speak filter=============================    lame <text>Rewrites the words you give it into the kind of "leet-speak" a lamer typeson IRC: o becomes 0 or (), you becomes U, and becomes &, i becomes 1, ebecomes 3, a trailing s becomes zz, and letters are randomly capitalised.    lame you are so cool and elite   ->   U are s0 c00l & eliteFrom the `silly' collection of joke filters posted to Usenet.  Source inSRC/lame/ORIG.